sequenceDiagram
    participant "External Payment Provider" as ExternalPaymentProvider
    participant "Scheduled Job Runner" as ScheduledJobRunner
    participant "API Host (Presentation)" as APIHostPresentation
    participant "Monetization Module" as MonetizationModule
    participant "In-Process Event Bus" as InProcessEventBus
    actor "Users Module" as UsersModule
    participant "Primary Database" as PrimaryDatabase
    participant "Audit Log Service" as AuditLogService

    ExternalPaymentProvider->>APIHostPresentation: 1. alt: Trigger via Webhook
    activate APIHostPresentation
    ExternalPaymentProvider->>APIHostPresentation: 1.1. POST /api/v1/webhooks/billing (event: SUBSCRIPTION_EXPIRED)
    APIHostPresentation-->>ExternalPaymentProvider: 200 OK or 4xx/5xx Error
    activate MonetizationModule
    APIHostPresentation->>MonetizationModule: 1.2. ProcessWebhook(payload)
    MonetizationModule-->>APIHostPresentation: void
    MonetizationModule->>MonetizationModule: 1.3. Business Rule: Verify subscription state and locate user.
    ScheduledJobRunner->>MonetizationModule: 2. alt: Trigger via Scheduled Job
    ScheduledJobRunner->>MonetizationModule: 2.1. Execute daily job: CheckForExpiredSubscriptionsJob
    MonetizationModule-->>ScheduledJobRunner: Job completion status.
    MonetizationModule->>PrimaryDatabase: 2.2. SELECT * FROM Subscriptions WHERE EndDate <= NOW() AND Status = 'Active'
    PrimaryDatabase-->>MonetizationModule: List<Subscription>
    MonetizationModule->>MonetizationModule: 3. loop: For each expired subscription
    MonetizationModule->>InProcessEventBus: 3.1. Publish(new SubscriptionTerminatedEvent(...))
    MonetizationModule->>AuditLogService: 3.2. LogAuditEvent('SUBSCRIPTION_CHANGE', ...)
    activate UsersModule
    InProcessEventBus->>UsersModule: 3.3. Dispatch SubscriptionTerminatedEvent
    UsersModule->>PrimaryDatabase: 3.4. UPDATE Users SET Role = 'FreeUser' WHERE UserId = @p0
    PrimaryDatabase-->>UsersModule: Rows affected
    UsersModule->>InProcessEventBus: 4. end loop
    APIHostPresentation->>ExternalPaymentProvider: 5. 200 OK
    ScheduledJobRunner->>MonetizationModule: 6. end alt

    note over APIHostPresentation: Webhook Idempotency: The webhook handler must be idempotent. It should check the current subscrip...
    note over UsersModule: The user's JWT is not immediately invalidated. The new 'FreeUser' role will be reflected in the J...

    deactivate UsersModule
    deactivate MonetizationModule
    deactivate APIHostPresentation
